35},"736777225694",[627],{"_key":628,"_type":436,"children":629,"markDefs":634,"style":461},"f22d91457c1f",[630],{"_key":631,"_type":440,"marks":632,"text":633},"32b1295bd270",[],"A friendly chat with our recruiter to discuss the role and your experience. We'll ask a few questions to understand your fit and, if all goes well, set up the next step.",[],"Phone Screening",{"_key":637,"blockText":638,"title":647},"ded3c788bc70",[639],{"_key":640,"_type":436,"children":641,"markDefs":646,"style":461},"712a983699ba",[642],{"_key":643,"_type":440,"marks":644,"text":645},"942fc907b8cc",[],"Here, you'll meet either the Hiring Manager or a key team member. It's a chance for a deeper conversation about your professional journey and to tackle some role-specific questions. This session is also your window into our team dynamics and company culture.",[],"First Interview",{"_key":649,"blockText":650,"title":659},"410bf39a210a",[651],{"_key":652,"_type":436,"children":653,"markDefs":658,"style":461},"3cccefe326d4",[654],{"_key":655,"_type":440,"marks":656,"text":657},"09e4c74dad96",[],"Post the first interview, we often ask candidates to showcase their skills through a practical assessment. This could be a home assignment or a task simulation, giving you a taste of the actual work.",[],"Professional Assessment",{"_key":661,"blockText":662,"title":671},"1df15702afde",[663],{"_key":664,"_type":436,"children":665,"markDefs":670,"style":461},"014b50541cdd",[666],{"_key":667,"_type":440,"marks":668,"text":669},"197e7a08e0c0",[],"If your first interview was with the Hiring Manager, this round introduces you to a department head or a VP. It's an opportunity to discuss broader aspects of the role and how it fits into the larger company vision.",[],"Second Interview",{"_key":673,"blockText":674,"title":683},"eb1c09fd96fd",[675],{"_key":676,"_type":436,"children":677,"markDefs":682,"style":461},"1f5d1a7f4d16",[678],{"_key":679,"_type":440,"marks":680,"text":681},"9d306ddf8b2c",[],"At this fi